    "html": "<div class=\"c-highlights o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-highlights__featured\">\n<h2 class=\"c-highlights__featured-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\tWe’ve been changing lives since 1950\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n<p>\n\t\t\t\tIn the past 75 years, Sightsavers has achieved amazing things. We work in more than 30 countries in Africa and Asia to train health workers, provide eye operations, support people with disabilities, improve women’s health and more. But we need your help.\n\t\t\t</p>\n<div class=\"c-highlights__featured-button\">\n<a class=\"c-btn\" href=\"/about-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFind out what we do\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list styled\">\n<h3 class=\"c-highlights__list-heading\">\n\t\t\t\tHow can I get involved?\n\t\t\t</h3>\n<ul class=\"c-highlights__list-ul\">\n<li class=\"c-highlights__list-li\">\n<a href=\"/how-to-help/gift-in-your-will/\" target=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image-container\">\n<div alt=\"Mary smiles as bubbles float round her head.\" class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image\" style=\"background:url(/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Sightsavers-Mary-plays-near-her-home-in-Malawi-580x326.jpg) center\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-container\">\n<h4 class=\"c-highlights__list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLeave a donation in your will\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<p class=\"c-highlights__list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA legacy gift to Sightsavers can help support our work for generations to come.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"c-highlights__list-li\">\n<a href=\"/stories-news-blogs/\" target=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image-container\">\n<div alt=\"A young girl wearing a hearing aid smiles behind a stack of papers at a classroom desk.\" class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image\" style=\"background:url(/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Sightsavers_10-year-old-Jharna-Bangladesh_CREDIT_Sightsavers-Bangladesh-580x326.png) center\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-container\">\n<h4 class=\"c-highlights__list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead and share our stories \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<p class=\"c-highlights__list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKeep up to date with our latest news, expert blogs and case studies. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"c-highlights__list-li\">\n<a href=\"/appeals/tv-appeals/\" target=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image-container\">\n<div alt=\"Mwiza sits on a step and rubs his eyes.\" class=\"c-highlights__list-content-image\" style=\"background:url(/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Mwiza-web-2-new-580x326.jpg) center\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-highlights__list-content-container\">\n<h4 class=\"c-highlights__list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSupport our TV appeal\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<p class=\"c-highlights__list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYour gift today could help stop a child going blind from preventable causes.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
