    "html": "<div class=\"c-icon-block o-module c-ip-block--grey\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-icon-block__title\"><strong>Together we’re making a difference</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-overlay\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-wrap\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__content\" data-mobile-scroll-inner=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img alt=\"A female optometrist uses an ophthalmoscope to examine a man's eyes.\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2405_Sightsavers-amna-examines-patient-inspire-project-pakistan-190203-580x326.jpg\">\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">About Sightsavers</h3>\n<p>Our mission is to prevent avoidable blindness, fight disease and ensure everyone can earn, learn and thrive.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/about-us/\">What we do</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-were-run/\">How we’re run</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-were-run/annual-reports/\">Our annual reports</a></li>\n</ul>\n</img></div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2504_Sightsavers-Esther-Nagetey-centre-moderates-the-Youth-Leadership-Now-event-580x326.png\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Campaigning</h3>\n<p>We campaign for disability rights and inclusion so everyone can participate equally in society.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/our-campaign/\">Our campaigning work</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://campaigning.sightsavers.org/why-we-campaign/\">Why we campaign</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/disability/\">Our work on disability</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img alt=\"James cheers while running the 2025 London Marathon. He's wearing a Sightsavers running vest with his name on the front.\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/2504_Sightsavers-fundraising-london-marathon-2025-james-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Fundraising</h3>\n<p>Our fundraisers and donors really do change lives. There are plenty of ways you can support us.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/how-to-help/\">Help as an individual</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-to-help/corporate-partners/\">Corporate partnerships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-to-help/gift-in-your-will/\">Leave a gift in your will</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
