    "html": "<div class=\"c-full-image-with-text o-module no-bottom-margin\" style=\"background-image: url(/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2602_Sightsavers-eye-health-clinical-officer-dr-robinson-kakamega-kenya-221519-1400x788.jpg); background-position: right \">\n<span class=\"screen-reader\">A male health worker smiles while sitting in front of an autorefractor.</span>\n<div class=\"c-full-image-with-text__inner o-layout-container c-full-image-with-text__inner--align-left\">\n<div class=\"c-full-image-with-text__content\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"c-full-image-with-text__title\"><strong>See our work in action</strong></h2>\n<span class=\"o-border-small\"></span>\n<div class=\"c-full-image-with-text__mobile-image\">\n<img alt=\"A male health worker smiles while sitting in front of an autorefractor.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2602_Sightsavers-eye-health-clinical-officer-dr-robinson-kakamega-kenya-221519-1024x575.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-full-image-with-text__text\">\n<img align=\"left\" alt=\"\" height=\"60\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Sightsavers_icons_Disability_RGB.svg\" style=\"margin: -5px 15px 0px 0px;\" width=\"60\"/><a href=\"/stories/2024/11/the-impact-of-inclusion/\"> Meet three disability inclusion champions:</a> See how our projects are changing the world. <br/><br/> <img align=\"left\" alt=\"\" height=\"60\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Sightsavers_icons_Trachoma_RGB.svg\" style=\"margin: -5px 15px 0px 0px;\" width=\"60\"/><a href=\"/eye-conditions/trachoma/history-of-trachoma/\">Explore the history of trachoma:</a> Learn about the disease that affects millions. <br/><br/> <img align=\"left\" alt=\"\" height=\"60\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Sightsavers_icons_Cataract_RGB-2.svg\" style=\"margin: -5px 15px 30px 0px;\" width=\"60\"/><a href=\"/eye-conditions/trachoma/surgery-camp/\">Visit our rural surgery camp:</a> Take a virtual tour of our operating theatre where miracles happen.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
